al tenderness","usesLetters":["pi","ta","ri","sa","ne","ha"]},{"id":"pitrihirdoy","bengali":"পিতৃহৃদয়","transliteration":"pitrihridoy","english":"father's loving heart","usesLetters":["pi","ta","ri","hri","da","ya"]},{"id":"matrihirdoy","bengali":"মাতৃহৃদয়","transliteration":"matrihridoy","english":"mother's heart, maternal soul","usesLetters":["ma","a","ta","ri","hri","da","ya"]},{"id":"batsollorosh","bengali":"বাৎসল্যরস","transliteration":"batsollorosh","english":"parental sentiment, maternal tenderness rasa","usesLetters":["ba","a","ta","sa","la","ya","ra","sa"]},{"id":"shishushulobh","bengali":"শিশুসুলভ","transliteration":"shishushulobh","english":"childlike, innocent, naive","usesLetters":["shi","shu","su","la","bha"]},{"id":"shishusulobh_hashi","bengali":"শিশুসুলভ হাসি","transliteration":"shishushulobh hashi","english":"childlike innocent smile","usesLetters":["shi","shu","su","la","bha","ha","a","shi"]},{"id":"mishuk","bengali":"মিশুক","transliteration":"mishuk","english":"sociable, friendly, gregarious","usesLetters":["mi","shu","ka"]},{"id":"omishuk","bengali":"অমিশুক","transliteration":"omishuk","english":"unsociable, reserved, standoffish","usesLetters":["a","mi","shu","ka"]},{"id":"mishukota","bengali":"মিশুক স্বভাব","transliteration":"mishuk shobhab","english":"affable gregarious nature","usesLetters":["mi","shu","ka","sha","ba","bha","a","ba"]},{"id":"milito_howa","bengali":"একত্র হওয়া","transliteration":"ekotro howa","english":"to assemble, to gather together","usesLetters":["e","ka","ta","ra","ha","o","ya","a"]},{"id":"ekotro_bhab","bengali":"একত্রীকরণ করা","transliteration":"ekotrikoron kora","english":"to unify, to integrate","usesLetters":["e","ka","ta","ri","ka","ra","na","ka","ra","a"]},{"id":"shommilitobhab","bengali":"সম্মিলন ক্ষেত্র","transliteration":"shommilon kkhetro","english":"meeting ground, confluence arena","usesLetters":["sa","ma","mi","la","na","ka","khe","ta","ra"]},{"id":"milonthirtha","bengali":"মিলনতীর্থ","transliteration":"m